From 1dc0a32d610c9c4c734d022196c2e43bc74cf767 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nicolas Goueslain <nicolas.goueslain@nxp.com>
Date: Thu, 21 May 2026 19:03:41 +0200
Subject: [filter] Add Ara-2 NPU sub-plugin for NXP ara240

Add tensor_filter sub-plugin for Ara-2 NPU (ara240) with DMA-BUF support.

Key features:
- Three-tier invoke architecture (pool match, external DMA-BUF fd, CPU fallback)
- DMA-BUF zero-copy via V2 invoke API
- Runtime DMA-BUF enable/disable via custom property
- Automatic quantization metadata extraction
- Single-buffer pool architecture for sequential processing
- Integration with dvproxy runtime API

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [embedded specific]
Signed-off-by: Nicolas Goueslain <nicolas.goueslain@nxp.com>
---
